ame\",\"title\":\"مواي تاي\",\"title_en\":\"Muay Thai\",\"text\":\"تدرّب على الركلات واللكمات والركب.\",\"text_en\":\"Train with kicks, punches and knees.\"},{\"icon\":\"belt\",\"title\":\"تايكوندو\",\"title_en\":\"Taekwondo\",\"text\":\"طوّر سرعتك ومرونتك وتقنيات الركل.\",\"text_en\":\"Develop speed, flexibility and kicking technique.\"},{\"icon\":\"trophy\",\"title\":\"جوجيتسو\",\"title_en\":\"Jiu-Jitsu\",\"text\":\"تعلّم السيطرة والقتال الأرضي بالتقنية.\",\"text_en\":\"Learn grappling and ground control through technique.\"},{\"icon\":\"shield\",\"title\":\"مصارعة\",\"title_en\":\"Wrestling\",\"text\":\"قوّة وتوازن وإسقاطات تحت إشراف المدرب.\",\"text_en\":\"Build strength, balance and takedowns with a coach.\"}]","position":2,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"Programs","title_en":"Choose your discipline","subtitle_en":"Five combat sports for children and adults","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"sections","source_key":"4","data":{"id":4,"type":"pricing","anchor":"pricing","nav_label":"الأسعار","title":"باقات الاشتراك","subtitle":"اختر المدة المناسبة وابدأ اليوم","body":"","items":"[]","position":3,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"Membership","title_en":"Membership plans","subtitle_en":"Choose a plan and get started today","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"sections","source_key":"5","data":{"id":5,"type":"offers","anchor":"offers","nav_label":"العروض","title":"العروض الحالية","subtitle":"فرص محدودة — لا تفوّتها","body":"","items":"[]","position":4,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"Offers","title_en":"Current offers","subtitle_en":"Limited-time offers — do not miss out","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"sections","source_key":"6","data":{"id":6,"type":"schedule","anchor":"schedule","nav_label":"الجدول","title":"جدول الحصص","subtitle":"حصص للصغار والكبار من السبت إلى الخميس — اختر يوماً لعرض المواعيد","body":"","items":"[]","position":5,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"Schedule","title_en":"Class schedule","subtitle_en":"Classes for children and adults, Saturday through Thursday. Choose a day to see the times.","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"sections","source_key":"7","data":{"id":7,"type":"faq","anchor":"faq","nav_label":"أسئلة شائعة","title":"أسئلة شائعة","subtitle":"","body":"","items":"[{\"q\":\"كيف أسجّل دخولي لحسابي؟\",\"a\":\"من زر «دخول المشتركين» باستخدام رقم الهوية أو الإقامة ورقم الجوال المسجّل لدى النادي.\",\"q_en\":\"How do I sign in?\",\"a_en\":\"Use the national ID or residency number and the mobile number registered with the club.\"},{\"q\":\"كيف أعرف متى ينتهي اشتراكي؟\",\"a\":\"تظهر حالة اشتراكك وعدد الأيام المتبقية داخل حسابك، وسنرسل لك تنبيهاً عند قرب الانتهاء وعند انتهائه.\",\"q_en\":\"How can I check when my membership ends?\",\"a_en\":\"Your membership status and remaining days appear in your account. You will also see a reminder when it is close to expiring or has expired.\"},{\"q\":\"كيف أجدّد اشتراكي؟\",\"a\":\"تواصل معنا عبر واتساب أو زر النادي، وسيتم تجديد الاشتراك وتحديث حسابك مباشرة.\",\"q_en\":\"How do I renew?\",\"a_en\":\"Contact us on WhatsApp or call the club, and we will update your membership.\"},{\"q\":\"أين أجد مواعيد الحصص؟\",\"a\":\"في قسم «جدول الحصص» اختر اليوم لتظهر لك الحصص والمدربين.\",\"q_en\":\"Where can I find class times?\",\"a_en\":\"Choose a day in the Class Schedule section to view classes and coaches.\"}]","position":6,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"FAQ","title_en":"Frequently asked questions","subtitle_en":"","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"sections","source_key":"8","data":{"id":8,"type":"contact","anchor":"contact","nav_label":"تواصل معنا","title":"تواصل معنا","subtitle":"يسعدنا استقبالك","body":"","items":"[]","position":7,"visible":1,"nav_label_en":"Contact","title_en":"Contact us","subtitle_en":"We would be glad to hear from you","body_en":""}},{"source_table":"settings","source_key":"club_name","data":{"key":"club_name","value":"فايت كلوب"}},{"source_table":"settings","source_key":"club_name_en","data":{"key":"club_name_en","value":"Fight Club"}},{"source_table":"settings","source_key":"tagline",